### Login para obter o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40001/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### InsertAlocado
POST http://localhost:40001/insertAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidfk": 1,
    "piqueteidfk": 1,
    "datainicio": "2026-11-23",
    "datafinal": "2026-11-30"
}

### GetAllAlocado
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAlocadoByID
GET http://localhost:40001/getAlocadoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### UpdateAlocado
PUT http://localhost:40001/updateAlocado/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidfk": 1,
    "piqueteidfk": 1,
    "datainicio": "2026-11-24",
    "datafinal": "2026-12-05"
}

### DeleteAlocado (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:40001/deleteAlocado/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAllAlocado depois do delete (o registro removido não deve aparecer)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Teste sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAlocado HTTP/1.1
